{"id": "99210016", "name": "תוחלת ושונות של צירוף לינארי של בינומי ופואסוני בלתי תלויים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>יהיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathrm{Bin}\\left({{CT:0}},\\frac{1}{ {{CT:1}} }\\right)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\sim\\mathrm{Poi}({{CT:2}})\\)</span> משתנים מקריים בלתי תלויים, ונסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Z={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[Z]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[Z]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> לינאריות התוחלת; שונות של סכום משתנים בלתי תלויים, ו-\\(\\mathsf{Var}[aX+b]=a^2\\mathsf{Var}[X]\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — התוחלות והשונויות</b><br>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathrm{Bin}(n,p)\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]=np\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[X]=np(1-p)\\)</span>. עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\sim\\mathrm{Poi}(\\lambda)\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[Y]=\\mathsf{Var}[Y]=\\lambda\\)</span>. כאן:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X]={{CT:4}},\\quad \\mathsf{Var}[X]={{CT:5}},\\quad \\mathbb{E}[Y]=\\mathsf{Var}[Y]={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — התוחלת</b><br>לפי לינאריות התוחלת (לא צריך אי-תלות):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[Z]={{CT:6}}\\,\\mathbb{E}[X]-{{CT:7}}\\,\\mathbb{E}[Y]+\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)={{CT:9}}-{{CT:10}}+\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)={{CT:11}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השונות</b><br>קבוע לא משנה שונות. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> בלתי תלויים, ולכן השונות של הסכום היא סכום השונויות, ומקדם יוצא בריבוע (גם הסימן מינוס):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathsf{Var}[Z]={{CT:12}}\\,\\mathsf{Var}[X]+{{CT:13}}\\,\\mathsf{Var}[Y]={{CT:14}}+{{CT:15}}={{CT:16}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "aa^2*nn*(1/dd)*(1-1/dd)-bb^2*la", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>שונות של \\(-bY\\) היא \\(b^2\\mathsf{Var}[Y]\\), עם סימן פלוס: השונויות של משתנים בלתי תלויים תמיד מתחברות.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["aa", "bb", "cc", "dd", "la", "nn", "t1", "t2"], "nvariants": 50}